                <pb facs="0145" n="35" sameAs="frus:frus1928v03/pg35"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.51 Struma Valley/9: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Greece</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Skinner</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-04-28T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 28,
                                1928—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>27. Your 32 April 26, 7 p.m. Department has obtained statement of ownership of
                    stock of Foundation Company (Foreign) on the basis of which it authorizes you to
                    answer in the affirmative.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
